era Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">dataInput()[which(dataInput()$Date&lt;=input$dates[2]&amp;dataInput()$Date&gt;=input$dates[1]),]</code>, it returns an error <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">invalid argument type</code>.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I suspect it to be <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">dataInput()</code> being a data.frame, but after I change it to <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">datatable(dataInput()[which(dataInput()$Date&lt;=input$dates[2]&amp;dataInput()$Date&gt;=input$dates[1]),])</code> and add the formatCurrency code, it returns error <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">Error in [: incorrect number of dimensions</code>.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Now I am completely confused. Where should I add the formatCurrency code?</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I also posted this in StackOverflow: <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/38642515/shiny-datatable-formatcurrency\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/38642515/shiny-datatable-formatcurrency&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361761129000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18JL526Dxgc4FjNVAhlxDy\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/38642515/shiny-datatable-formatcurrency</a></p></div></blockquote></div>"
